ul atmosphere. Vespers services in the evening also provide special experiences."}]]}],["$","div","4",{"className":"rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-medium text-white mb-2","children":"Is the train station far from the monastery?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-400","children":"Einsiedeln station is about 1 kilometer from the monastery – a 15-minute walk or 3-minute taxi ride. We're happy to transfer visitors, especially those with mobility concerns."}]]}]]}]]}]
